Steve McCown (Anonyome Labs, Inc.): So anyway, I put the text there, you can read through it. I'll give you some of the highlights. Number one is it passed our, Senate and House of Representatives unanimously.

649
01:16:15.180 --> 01:16:30.680
Steve McCown (Anonyome Labs, Inc.): So, think of all the stuff going on in the world and all the things that happen in such a bipartisan fashion. This is pretty unique, that, we had, both sides of our political aisle agree that this was important to do.

650
01:16:30.720 --> 01:16:46.279
Steve McCown (Anonyome Labs, Inc.): So right now, it's passed the legislature, and on Friday, it was sent over to the governor for signature, which he's expected to do, usually within the couple of weeks after the end of the legislative session, which was Friday.

651
01:16:48.130 --> 01:16:56.270
Steve McCown (Anonyome Labs, Inc.): So, what it does is it creates a new program. So, last year, we had a SETI bill, which,

