01:16:56.290 --> 01:17:08.310
Steve McCown (Anonyome Labs, Inc.): started, the process for evaluating things leading up to an identity. This is actually kicking off the program within the Department of Government Operations.

653
01:17:08.390 --> 01:17:25.080
Steve McCown (Anonyome Labs, Inc.): So, a couple of notable things that are in the bill. There's a Digital Identity Bill of Rights. So, similar to the U.S. Constitution, there are… the first 10 amendments to the Constitution constitute what's called the Bill of Rights. So, this was modeled after that.

654
01:17:25.100 --> 01:17:29.789
Steve McCown (Anonyome Labs, Inc.): These are rights kind of against government in support of the individual.

