01:17:29.890 --> 01:17:36.429
Steve McCown (Anonyome Labs, Inc.): And, so there will… there's a number of things. I won't go through all of them right now.

656
01:17:36.890 --> 01:17:56.720
Steve McCown (Anonyome Labs, Inc.): Seti is now going to be required for any new government system that accepts any type of digital identity, whatever it is. So for new systems, they'll have to… they can accept other types of digital identity, but they'll have to accept SETI in the process.

657
01:17:56.770 --> 01:18:03.420
Steve McCown (Anonyome Labs, Inc.): It's specif- the bill specifically calls out the typical things the government regulates.

